{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31326","headline":"赠黄蘖山僧希运 · 裴休","name":"赠黄蘖山僧希运","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾传达士心中印，额有圆珠七尺身。\n挂锡十年栖蜀水，浮杯今日渡漳滨。\n一千龙象随高步，万里香华结胜因。\n拟欲事师爲弟子，不知将法付何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31326.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31326","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}